Interface design

Install:
  Install the missing skill; prepare Node.js, pnpm and Git as needed.

Upgrade:
  Back up and replace the installed skill; restore previous skill files if replacement fails.

Status:
  Report skill locations based on SKILL.md presence.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Source: https://github.com/oil-oil/oil-ui
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/oil-ui
  Existing copies at ${CODEX_HOME:-$HOME/.codex}/skills/oil-ui are consolidated into links to the destination when skill files are replaced.
